#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:51
msgid "BTCPay Server URL"
msgstr "URL du Serveur BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:131
msgid "Full URL to your BTCPay Server (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "URL complète de votre serveur BTCPay (HTTPS requis)."

#. translators: 1: field label, e.g. "BTCPay API Key". 2: minimum length.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:138
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:387
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:72
msgid "BTCPay API Key"
msgstr "Clé API BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:140
msgid "API key for BTCPay (min 20 characters)."
msgstr "Clé API pour BTCPay (min. 20 caractères)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:146
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:388
msgid "BTCPay Store ID"
msgstr "Identifiant du Magasin BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:148
msgid "Your BTCPay store identifier."
msgstr "Votre identifiant de magasin BTCPay."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:153
msgid "BTCPay Lightning Payment Method ID (advanced)"
msgstr "ID de la Méthode de Paiement Lightning BTCPay (avancé)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:155
msgid ""
"Only change this if your BTCPay Server version reports a different Lightning "
"payment method identifier than the default. Leave as \"BTC-LN\" unless "
"instructed otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Ne modifiez ceci que si votre version du serveur BTCPay signale un "
"identificateur de méthode de paiement Lightning différent de celui par "
"défaut. Laissez-le comme \"BTC-LN\" sauf indication contraire."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:162
msgid "BTCPay Connection Test"
msgstr "Test de Connexion BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:167
msgid "Webhook Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration du Webhook"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:169
msgid ""
"Automatic payment confirmation via webhooks (BTCPay push / lnd polling) "
"ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me Premium add-on. In the free version, "
"Lightning payments are confirmed manually — the settings below are a preview "
"and are not editable yet."
msgstr ""
"La confirmation automatique des paiements via webhooks (push BTCPay / "
"interrogation lnd) arrivera dans la future extension Premium de "
"PayCrypto.Me. Dans la version gratuite, les paiements Lightning sont "
"confirmés manuellement — les réglages ci-dessous sont un aperçu et ne sont "
"pas encore modifiables."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:172
msgid "BTCPay Webhook Secret"
msgstr "Secret du Webhook BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:174
msgid "Reserved for the Premium add-on. Not used by the free version."
msgstr "Réservé à l'extension Premium. Non utilisé dans la version gratuite."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:175
msgid "Available in the Premium add-on"
msgstr "Disponible dans l'extension Premium"

#. translators: %s: field label, e.g. "BTCPay Server URL".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:183
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:382
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:70
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:106
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:112
msgid "lnd REST URL"
msgstr "URL REST de lnd"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:185
msgid "REST API endpoint (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "Point d'accès API REST (HTTPS requis)."

#. translators: 1: field label, e.g. "BTCPay API Key". 2: minimum length.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:192
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:383
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:125
msgid "lnd Macaroon (hex)"
msgstr "Macaroon de lnd (hex)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:194
msgid "Admin macaroon in hexadecimal format (min 100 characters)."
msgstr "Macaroon administrateur au format hexadécimal (min. 100 caractères)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:200
msgid "SSL Certificate (PEM)"
msgstr "Certificat SSL (PEM)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:202
msgid ""
"Optional: Paste your SSL certificate in PEM format. If provided, this will "
"be used for verification instead of disabling SSL checks."
msgstr ""
"Optionnel: Collez votre certificat SSL au format PEM. S'il est fourni, il "
"sera utilisé pour la vérification au lieu de désactiver les vérifications "
"SSL."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:208
msgid "Verify SSL Certificate"
msgstr "Vérifier le Certificat SSL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:210
msgid "Enable SSL certificate verification"
msgstr "Activer la vérification du certificat SSL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:211
msgid ""
"Enable for production. If disabled and no certificate is provided, SSL "
"verification is skipped (development only)."
msgstr ""
"Activer pour la production. S'il est désactivé et qu'aucun certificat n'est "
"fourni, la vérification SSL est ignorée (développement uniquement)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:216
msgid "lnd REST Connection Test"
msgstr "Test de Connexion REST de lnd"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:283
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:319
msgid "🔌 Test connection"
msgstr "🔌 Tester la connexion"

#. translators: 1: settings field label, 2: selected Lightning node type.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:395
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is empty, and it is required for the selected node type (%2$s)."
msgstr ""
"%1$s est vide alors qu'il est requis pour le type de nœud sélectionné (%2$s)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:35
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:365
msgid "On-Chain"
msgstr "On-Chain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:36
msgid "Accept Bitcoin payments Non-custodial via On-Chain"
msgstr "Acceptez les paiements Bitcoin non-dépositaires via On-Chain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:39
msgid ""
"Use directly your Bitcoin wallet to pay. Place the order to view the QR code "
"and payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez directement votre portefeuille Bitcoin pour payer. Passez la "
"commande pour voir le code QR et les instructions de paiement."

#. translators: 1: list of missing PHP extensions, e.g. "GMP". 2: bech32 address prefix, e.g. "bc1".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:75
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This server is missing the PHP %1$s extension, which is required to derive "
"addresses from an xPub. Ask your host to enable it, or configure a single "
"fixed address starting with %2$s instead."
msgstr ""
"Ce serveur n'a pas l'extension PHP %1$s, nécessaire pour dériver des "
"adresses à partir d'un xPub. Demandez à votre hébergeur de l'activer, ou "
"configurez à la place une seule adresse fixe commençant par %2$s."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:82
msgid "No network is selected in the gateway settings."
msgstr "Aucun réseau n'est sélectionné dans les réglages de la passerelle."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:86
msgid ""
"No wallet xPub or Bitcoin address is configured in the gateway settings."
msgstr ""
"Aucun xPub de portefeuille ni adresse Bitcoin n'est configuré dans les "
"réglages de la passerelle."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:146
msgid "This server cannot derive addresses from an extended public key."
msgstr ""
"Ce serveur ne peut pas dériver d'adresses à partir d'une clé publique "
"étendue."

#. translators: 1: list of missing PHP extensions, e.g. "GMP". 2: bech32 address prefix, e.g. "bc1".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:149
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The PHP %1$s extension is not installed, so an xPub/yPub/zPub cannot be used "
"here — ask your host to enable it. You can still accept on-chain payments "
"right now by entering a single fixed address starting with %2$s in the field "
"below; every order is then paid to that same address, which is worse for "
"privacy but works without the extension."
msgstr ""
"L'extension PHP %1$s n'est pas installée, un xPub/yPub/zPub ne peut donc pas "
"être utilisé ici — demandez à votre hébergeur de l'activer. Vous pouvez tout "
"de même accepter des paiements on-chain dès maintenant en saisissant dans le "
"champ ci-dessous une seule adresse fixe commençant par %2$s ; toutes les "
"commandes sont alors payées à cette même adresse, ce qui est moins bon pour "
"la confidentialité mais fonctionne sans l'extension."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:170
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:128
msgid "Permission denied."
msgstr "Permission refusée."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:179
msgid "Reset failed. Check WooCommerce logs for details."
msgstr ""
"La réinitialisation a échoué. Vérifiez les journaux WooCommerce pour plus de "
"détails."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:185
msgid "Reset request received."
msgstr "Demande de réinitialisation reçue."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:193
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:198
msgid "Security check failed"
msgstr "La vérification de sécurité a échoué"

#. translators: %s is the field label being validated, e.g. "Wallet xPub".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:210
#, php-format
msgid "Please enter a valid %s."
msgstr "Veuillez entrer un %s valide."

#. translators: %s: the underlying error message.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:233
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The wallet key could not be validated because of an internal error: %s. "
"Nothing was saved. This is not a problem with the key you entered."
msgstr ""
"La clé du portefeuille n'a pas pu être validée en raison d'une erreur "
"interne : %s. Rien n'a été enregistré. Le problème ne vient pas de la clé "
"que vous avez saisie."

#. translators: 1: network the key actually belongs to, 2: network selected in settings.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:242
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This key belongs to %1$s, but the selected network is %2$s. Please provide a "
"key for the selected network."
msgstr ""
"Cette clé appartient à %1$s, mais le réseau sélectionné est %2$s. Veuillez "
"fournir une clé pour le réseau sélectionné."

#. translators: %s is the field label being validated, e.g. "Wallet xPub".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:248
#, php-format
msgid "The %s provided is not valid for the selected network."
msgstr "Le %s fourni n'est pas valide pour le réseau sélectionné."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:265
msgid "Wallet xPub"
msgstr "Wallet xPub"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:274
msgid "Testnet Wallet xPub"
msgstr "Testnet Wallet xPub"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:289
msgid "Network Identifier"
msgstr "Identifiant Réseau"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:293
msgid ""
"Tip: It is always preferable to use the wallet xPub rather than a wallet "
"address for Bitcoin payments."
msgstr ""
"Conseil: Il est toujours préférable d'utiliser le xPub du portefeuille "
"plutôt qu'une adresse de portefeuille pour les paiements Bitcoin."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:297
msgid "Payment Timeout (hours)"
msgstr "Délai d'Expiration du Paiement (heures)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:299
msgid ""
"Automatic order expiry after the timeout ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Premium add-on. In the free version, on-chain addresses stay valid until "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"L'expiration automatique de la commande après le délai arrivera dans la "
"future extension Premium de PayCrypto.Me. Dans la version gratuite, les "
"adresses on-chain restent valides jusqu'au paiement."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:305
msgid "Payment number of confirmations"
msgstr "Nombre de confirmations de paiement"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:307
msgid ""
"Automatic on-chain confirmation tracking ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Premium add-on. In the free version, payments are verified manually."
msgstr ""
"Le suivi automatique des confirmations on-chain arrivera dans la future "
"extension Premium de PayCrypto.Me. Dans la version gratuite, les paiements "
"sont vérifiés manuellement."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:314
msgid "Danger Area"
msgstr "Zone Dangereuse"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:317
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Avertissement:"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:317
msgid ""
"Resetting the payment derivation index will lead to the reuse of addresses "
"and loss of past data. Proceed with caution and ensure you understand the "
"implications."
msgstr ""
"La réinitialisation de l'index de dérivation du paiement entraînera la "
"réutilisation d'adresses et la perte de données antérieures. Procédez avec "
"prudence et assurez-vous de bien comprendre les implications."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:319
msgid "Reset payment address derivation index"
msgstr "Réinitialiser l'index de dérivation de l'adresse de paiement"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:366
msgid "Testnet"
msgstr "Testnet"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:492
msgid ""
"A fixed Bitcoin address was saved. Payments will work, but every order is "
"paid to this same address. For better privacy, we recommend using an "
"extended public key (xpub/ypub/zpub) instead, which automatically creates a "
"new address for each order."
msgstr ""
"Une adresse Bitcoin fixe a été enregistrée. Les paiements fonctionneront, "
"mais chaque commande sera payée à cette même adresse. Pour une meilleure "
"confidentialité, nous recommandons d'utiliser plutôt une clé publique "
"étendue (xpub/ypub/zpub), qui crée automatiquement une nouvelle adresse pour "
"chaque commande."

#: includes/processors/abstract-class-lightning-processor.php:85
msgid ""
"We could not save your Lightning invoice. Please try again or contact the "
"store."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons pas pu enregistrer votre facture Lightning. Veuillez réessayer "
"ou contacter la boutique."

#: includes/processors/abstract-class-lightning-processor.php:167
msgid ""
"Your Lightning invoice is taking longer than expected to generate. Please "
"try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"La génération de votre facture Lightning prend plus de temps que prévu. "
"Veuillez réessayer dans un instant."

